### ==============================================================================
### FASE 8: AUDIT LOGS, SETTINGS, HARDENING & OPENAPI SPECIFICATION (VS Code REST Client)
### ==============================================================================
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. DOKUMENTASI OPENAPI (PUBLIK)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 1.1 Unduh Spesifikasi OpenAPI (YAML)
GET {{baseUrl}}/docs/openapi.yaml

### 1.2 Unduh Spesifikasi OpenAPI (JSON)
GET {{baseUrl}}/docs/openapi.json

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. AUTENTIKASI & CSRF
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 2.1 Ambil Token CSRF
# @name getCsrf
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/csrf

@csrfToken = {{getCsrf.response.body.csrf_token}}

### 2.2 Login sebagai Akuntansi (Akses Penuh Audit Logs & Pengaturan Sistem)
# @name loginAkuntansi
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "email": "dya@ptcn.id",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2.3 Login sebagai Manager (Akses Terbatas Audit Logs Unit Cakupan)
# @name loginManager
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "email": "budi@ptcn.id",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2.4 Login sebagai PIC Unit (Ditolak dari Audit Logs & Settings)
# @name loginPic
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "email": "rina@ptcn.id",
  "password": "password123"
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. AUDIT LOGS (/api/audit-logs)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 3.1 Akuntansi: Ambil Jejak Audit Global (Paginasi Default)
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit-logs?page=1&limit=20

### 3.2 Akuntansi: Filter Jejak Audit berdasarkan Entitas & Aksi
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit-logs?entity=budget_document&action=SUBMIT&page=1&limit=10

### 3.3 Akuntansi: Filter Jejak Audit berdasarkan Unit & Rentang Tanggal
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit-logs?unit_id=1&start_date=2026-01-01&end_date=2026-12-31

### 3.4 Manager: Ambil Jejak Audit (Otomatis Dibatasi ke Unit Cakupannya)
# (Jalankan setelah login sebagai Manager)
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit-logs?page=1&limit=10

### 3.5 Manager: Mencoba Mengakses Audit Unit di Luar Wewenang (Ditolak 403 UNIT_ACCESS_DENIED)
# (Jalankan setelah login sebagai Manager, unit_id di luar wewenang)
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit-logs?unit_id=999

### 3.6 PIC: Mencoba Mengakses Audit Logs (Ditolak 403 FORBIDDEN_ROLE)
# (Jalankan setelah login sebagai PIC)
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit-logs

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. PENGATURAN SISTEM (/api/settings)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 4.1 Baca Semua Pengaturan Sistem (Akuntansi)
GET {{baseUrl}}/settings

### 4.2 Perbarui Pengaturan Sistem (Valid - Akuntansi)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/settings
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "settings": {
    "investment_threshold": 5000000,
    "investment_threshold_basis": "unit_price",
    "investment_text_max_length": 300,
    "warning_percent": 80,
    "critical_percent": 100,
    "auto_reopen_on_return": true,
    "auto_close_on_deadline": true,
    "reminder_days": [3, 1],
    "accounting_contact": "akuntansi@ptcn.id"
  }
}

### 4.3 Uji Validasi: Nilai Tidak Valid (Ditolak 422 UNPROCESSABLE_ENTITY)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/settings
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "settings": {
    "warning_percent": 105,
    "critical_percent": 50,
    "investment_threshold_basis": "invalid_basis"
  }
}

### 4.4 Non-Akuntansi (Manager/PIC) Mengubah Setting (Ditolak 403 FORBIDDEN_ROLE)
# (Jalankan setelah login sebagai Manager atau PIC)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/settings
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "settings": {
    "warning_percent": 75
  }
}
